directImageComplex -- direct image complex
******************************************

  * Usage: 
        directImageComplex F
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * Regularity => ..., default value null

Description
===========

Forms a minimal free complex representing the direct image complex of $F$ in
the derived category, where $F$ is a module, chain complex or map of modules.

Caveat
======

The option "Regularity" is currently not supported.

